# Your living room just caught the Entropic Virus. 
Not the world-ending kind. The boring kind. You know, like Tuesdays.

HEALER is a fast-paced, chaotic, and questionably therapeutic mixed reality roguelite featuring a global leaderboard where you can prove you’re better than strangers.

{1299371742236658}

Pop bubbles, solve puzzles, and rescue absurd Cosmic Critters while battling a smug interdimensional virus determined to make your universe boring again. 
{25086948624290038}

Each run reshapes your environment in unpredictable ways. It’s easy to pick up, hard to stop, and beautiful enough to make you question whether reality was ever that impressive to begin with.  

{3169853029858855}
The first 300 reviewers will have their usernames immortalized inside the game as hidden Easter eggs, eternal glory, or at least a weird critter muttering your name somewhere deep in the void.






{806715285475341}

HEALER is a mixed reality rogue-lite bubble popper where your room transforms into an ever-changing universe. Wield the power of creation to evolve your space and fight back against an interdimensional virus trying to trap you in a dull, lifeless reality. Healer starts easy, then gets intense. One wrong move, and it’s all over.

